  "overview": "Join the New Mechanized Cavalry and Prepare for War.\n\nThe world is at war. Artillery is the answer, but Artillery is now highly mobile. Enter your mechanized unit, and neutralize all that oppose you.\n\n- Fight through Fog, Snow, and Night levels.\n- 360 degree freedom.\n- Optional Night Vision for added functionality.\n- Choose between missiles, cluster bombs, high velocity artillery cannons or machine guns to pulverize your enemy."
